# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day 06

## Topic
# Passive Voice + by

---

## Rule

### Passive Voice

Structure

Subject + be + Past Participle (+ by + Agent)

---

## When do we use "by"?

Use **by** to show **who performed the action**.

Examples

The report was written by Sarah.

The bridge was built by engineers.

The song was sung by the famous singer.

---

## Passive without "by"

If the person is not important, omit **by**.

Examples

The meeting was canceled.

The package was delivered this morning.

English is spoken in many countries.

---

## Remember

Passive = be + p.p.

by = 행동한 사람

---

## TOEIC Tip

시험에서는 **be동사 + 과거분사**가 보이면 먼저 수동태를 의심하자.

"by"가 없어도 수동태는 성립한다.
